# wear/woman/gown_sleeve_l: the gown's bell sleeve over her left forearm: cloth1 opening to an accent lining that falls two
# pixels past the wrist (front and back: outward; sides: trailing); the arm library's own shading kept, the hand bare
# One view per key of the woman's arm library (arms/adult/loco and arms/adult/pose woman_r / woman_l), on the same origin:
# a new arm key needs its view here too (the arm's forearm pixels recoloured in the sleeve's ramp, the hand left bare).
# GARB-W (P2b wave 2). Fitted to one body (STYLE_P2 22). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person woman
body woman
role garment gown
layer armNear
anchor shoulderL
keys armL
side L
z 1

